          "insert": "{ path: string, gitlink_head: string, checked_out_head: string }",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "; all values are nonblank and paths are unique. The proof demonstrates that cancellation left the canonical cycle and recursively observed submodule pointers untouched."
